1
00:00:08,493 --> 00:00:11,220
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:14,100
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,206 --> 00:00:17,460
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,566 --> 00:00:20,940
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:24,380
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,740
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,820
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:33,260
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:37,660
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:40,780
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:44,060
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:47,460
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:50,700
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:54,260
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:57,580
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:59,740
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:03,900
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:06,980
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:09,940
=Episode 4=

20
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:14,020
(A Legacy of Loyalty and Courage)

21
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,040
We're here.

22
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:47,040
Yunyi.

23
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:48,960
You've just joined the Cheng family.

24
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:50,160
By tradition,

25
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,360
you should first serve tea
to your elders.

26
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:54,200
It's the Cheng family custom,

27
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,640
and the rite of joining our family.

28
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:57,320
Yes.

29
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,040
Mother.

30
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,360
Mother.

31
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,960
I have a request.

32
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:06,960
Go ahead.

33
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,880
I brewed this tea myself.

34
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,880
But I am blind,

35
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,160
I fear I may have erred.

36
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:16,040
Miss Wan'er was kind enough to

37
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,640
come help me in my room.

38
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:20,280
This tea carries her care as well.

39
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,560
Though a servant by birth,

40
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,360
she is the concubine
the Cheng family gave to Young General.

41
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:29,400
She has served him for years.

42
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:30,520
In this house,

43
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,680
she has seniority over me.

44
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:33,880
By rights,

45
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:35,880
I should offer her tea first.

46
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,560
Please allow me, Mother.

47
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,360
It's rare to see such good manners.

48
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:43,520
Harmony between wife
and concubine blesses a house.

49
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,560
Granted.

50
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,160
Xia Yunyi.

51
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,240
What kind of manners are these?

52
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,240
Your elders are here,

53
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,840
yet you serve a maid first?

54
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,480
Aunt.

55
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,200
Wan'er is no maid.

56
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,760
She's Young General's concubine.

57
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:01,960
By honoring her,
I honor this family's customs.

58
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,720
Besides,

59
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:07,440
she and I brewed this tea together.

60
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,640
Since this is your kind gesture,

61
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:11,680
Wan'er,

62
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,000
you should accept it.

63
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,440
Go on.

64
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:38,120
Miss Wan'er, please.

65
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:43,640
You brewed this tea with me.

66
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,760
If anything is wrong with it,

67
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,120
you're just as guilty.

68
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:48,560
Drink.

69
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,320
I...

70
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,320
I just...

71
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,120
I'm so happy.

72
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,960
Young Madam's kindness is...

73
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:33,720
I...

74
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,200
Mother.

75
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,280
The tea's gone cold.

76
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,120
Let me brew a fresh pot.

77
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,080
Go ahead.

78
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,320
What did you put in the tea?

79
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,960
Wan'er put a centipede in the pot.

80
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,160
She wanted to humiliate me.

81
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,280
You certainly know how to turn
the tables on someone.

82
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:05,480
Xia Yunyi.

83
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,960
You crossed Wan'er today,

84
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,440
yesterday it was
Cheng Xiao and Zhou Lanxin.

85
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,320
Two days in this house,

86
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,040
and you've made three enemies.

87
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,360
Without my protection,

88
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,960
they won't spare you.

89
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:25,560
Young General,

90
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,000
are you worried about me?

91
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,280
I'm warning you.

92
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:30,400
If you die,

93
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,120
I'll have to marry again.

94
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,520
What a hassle.

95
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,520
General.

96
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,120
General.

97
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:38,960
Old Master...

98
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,440
There's a lead on Old Master's case.

99
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:46,800
Physician Li, who treated him back then,

100
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,640
is still alive.

101
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:50,600
He's hiding at an estate
eighty li from here.

102
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:51,560
Let's go.

103
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,560
I have military duties,

104
00:05:58,760 --> 00:05:59,920
and must leave at once.

105
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,360
I'll leave Qin Jun with you.

106
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:02,560
He'll look after you.

107
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:03,520
General.

108
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:06,280
Are you handing me over
like some piece of property?

109
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,800
You're my personal guard.

110
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:13,560
You protect whoever I say.

111
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:14,600
Yes.

112
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,120
Madam.

113
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:23,120
The General saved my life
on the battlefield.

114
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,960
From this day on,

115
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:24,760
your safety

116
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:26,120
is my responsibility.

117
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,280
Thank you.

118
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,480
Useless wretch!

119
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,960
Have you no eyes?

120
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,520
You bump into someone
and can't even apologize?

121
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,400
Sorry.

122
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,440
Aunt.

123
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:39,960
Who do you think you are?

124
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:43,040
A concubine's daughter,
strutting around this house?

125
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:44,520
(Cheng Xiaoxuan, third daughter)
Who do you think you are?

126
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,760
Your mother's a murderer.

127
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:46,960
That makes you a little murderer.

128
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:48,600
Get out of my way!

129
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,760
Who was that being scolded?

130
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,840
Cheng Xiaoxuan.

131
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,200
Third Master's daughter.

132
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,760
He died young.

133
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,240
And her mother...

134
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,360
She's had no one looking after her
since childhood.

135
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,360
It seems there are others here

136
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:09,200
whose lives are not their own,

137
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:10,720
with no one to turn to.

138
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:12,840
(Xia Residence)
Mother.

139
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:15,000
How is Cheng Mingzhi still alive?

140
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:17,000
That little blind girl got so lucky,

141
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,680
marrying into the General's house.

142
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,800
And you're just sitting here
drinking tea?

143
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,440
She's coming home tomorrow.

144
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:25,760
She'll surely come after us.

145
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:27,040
Let her come.

146
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,280
Mother!

147
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:30,280
Your father will be back tomorrow.

148
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:31,480
Remember this.

149
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,520
Tomorrow,

150
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,520
you and I

151
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:36,280
are going to put on a fine show.

152
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,800
Yes.

153
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,640
I understand, Mother.

154
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:59,360
(Your mother looked so "lovely" then.)

155
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:02,640
(Her eyes were wide open like this.)

156
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:14,760
Mother.

157
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,320
I swear to you,

158
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,360
those who harmed you,

159
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:22,280
I won't spare a single one.

160
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:26,280
Lady Wang and Xia Yunshu...

161
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:28,040
if it really was them,

162
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:31,320
I'll make them pay with their lives.

163
00:08:37,010 --> 00:08:39,610
Come on! Fresh and hot!

164
00:08:51,380 --> 00:08:54,940
(Xia Residence)

165
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:02,700
(Xia Residence)

166
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,480
Mind the threshold.

167
00:09:14,940 --> 00:09:16,860
(Wanqing Courtyard)

168
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,720
Yunyi has come home.

169
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,480
Where's Cheng Mingzhi?

170
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:24,280
Why didn't he come with you?

171
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:25,920
Don't tell me

172
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:29,080
he's already tired of you on day two.

173
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,080
Mother.

174
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,880
Don't rub salt in her wounds.

175
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,240
She's blind.

176
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:37,280
Marrying into the General's house
is already a miracle.

177
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:39,600
And she expects Young General
to escort her home?

178
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,480
As if she deserves it.

179
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:43,640
Whether I deserve it
isn't your concern, Sister.

180
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:45,880
But you're so devoted,

181
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:47,760
letting me take your place
in the marriage.

182
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:50,360
Planning to stay here with your mother

183
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:52,440
and grow old unmarried, I suppose?

184
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:54,720
You...

185
00:09:56,980 --> 00:09:58,060
(Qinghe Pavilion)

186
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,200
I came home today

187
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,880
to settle just one matter.

188
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:09,920
Lady Wang.

189
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,560
How did my mother die?

190
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:12,960
She was short-lived.

191
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,720
What has that to do with me?

192
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:15,760
Besides,

193
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,320
you're but a junior.

194
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,760
What right have you to question me?

195
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,920
Liu was just a low concubine
in my house.

196
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:23,120
So what if she died?

197
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,480
I even provided her with a coffin

198
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,760
and saw to her funeral.

199
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,600
That's more than generous.

200
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:29,600
Qin Jun.

201
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,280
Yes.

202
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:33,080
Make Lady Wang and Xia Yunshu
kneel to my mother.

203
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,360
Make them remember

204
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:36,440
who the real concubine was.

205
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,400
Please, ladies.

206
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:40,440
You dare!

207
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:41,600
Xia Yunyi!

208
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:43,800
How dare a concubine's daughter
lay hands on us?

209
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:44,840
Father won't spare you!

210
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,560
A concubine's daughter?

211
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:47,560
Sister.

212
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,360
All these years I never fought.

213
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,800
Not because I couldn't.

214
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:53,800
I only wanted peace for my mother.

215
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,880
Who was the one
who married into the Xia family

216
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:58,440
as a concubine after my mother.

217
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:01,000
Didn't your mother ever tell you?

218
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:03,320
I'll ask you one last time.

219
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,080
Kneel, or not?

220
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:19,200
Yunyi.

221
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:21,000
Let's talk this through.

222
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,800
You're still a daughter
of the Xia family.

223
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,480
You rarely come home.

224
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:28,520
Whatever it is,
we can discuss it calmly.

225
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:29,840
Besides,

226
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:32,480
I have prepared a generous gift for you.

227
00:11:35,520 --> 00:11:36,400
Servants.

228
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:39,400
Bring it up.

229
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:56,020
(In Memoriam)

230
00:12:15,546 --> 00:12:20,980
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

231
00:12:22,313 --> 00:12:27,060
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

232
00:12:27,520 --> 00:12:31,460
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

233
00:12:31,460 --> 00:12:34,740
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

234
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:40,860
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

235
00:12:42,993 --> 00:12:47,460
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

236
00:12:48,460 --> 00:12:50,820
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

237
00:12:50,820 --> 00:12:54,180
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

238
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,180
♪Cutting through old years♪

239
00:12:57,180 --> 00:12:58,900
♪We can never embrace again♪

240
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:03,980
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

241
00:13:04,073 --> 00:13:05,980
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

242
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:08,900
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

243
00:13:08,900 --> 00:13:10,740
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

244
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:12,460
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

245
00:13:12,460 --> 00:13:15,980
♪Too late to pull away♪

246
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:18,380
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

247
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:22,540
♪Now we must part♪

248
00:13:22,540 --> 00:13:26,140
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

249
00:13:26,140 --> 00:13:29,540
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

250
00:13:29,786 --> 00:13:31,860
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

251
00:13:31,860 --> 00:13:36,780
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
